    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Heffernan Auctioneers are delighted to bring this three-bed semi - detached house to the market.  Situated in quiet cul de sac.  The Sycamores is within walking distance to all amenities in Edenderry Town.  Accommodation briefly comprises of: Ent hall, livingroom /kitchen / dining(open plan), guest w.c., three bedrooms (main ensuite) and family bathroom.  \r\nM4 motorway is just 15 minutes drive from Edenderry & 40 minutes drive to Dublin.\r\nViewing highly recommended"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ACCOMMODATION IS AS FOLLOWS:\r\n\r\nEnt hall:\t\t\tTiled floor.  Ceiling coving & cornice.  Phone point.\r\nLivingroom:\t\t\tWood floor.  Ceiling coving.  Feature  fire.  T.V. point.\r\nKitchen / dining:\tFitted kitchen with tiled splashback.  Tiled floor.  French door to rear garden.  Ceiling coving.\r\nGuest w.c.:\t\t\tTiled floor.   W.C. & W.H.B.  Plumbed for washing machine.\r\nStairs & landing carpeted - with hotpress off\r\nMain Bed:\t\t\tWood floor.  Built in wardrobes.  T.V.  & phone points.\t\t\t\r\nEnsuite\t\tTiled floor & wall surround.  Shower.   w.c, w.h.b.  \r\nBedroom 2:\t\tWood floor.  Built in wardrobes.  T.V. point.\r\nBedroom 3 \t\tWood floor. Built in wardrobes. \r\nBathroom:\t\tFully tiled   Bath with shower over.  W.c. & w.h.b."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tIdeal starter / family home.\r\n•\tBarna shed to rear.\r\n•\tLandscaped garden\r\n•\tPatio area to rear.\r\n•\tConcrete driveway.\r\n•\tWalking distance to town centre.\r\n•\tDublin 40 mins.\r\n•\t15 mins to M4 motorway\r\n•\tDaily bus service hourly to & from Dublin"
      },
      {
